# Design stewardship（spec_designer）

**Requirements**: `docs/requirements/<slug>/`（P1–P2）  
**Specs**: `docs/design/`（H0–H5）  
**ADR & glossary**: `docs/adr/`, `docs/glossary/`  
**Plans**: `.agents/plans/` → **`plan_slicer`**

## When to use

- Unclear requirements or architecture choices
- Spec / system design authoring
- Tradeoff comparison before planning
- ADR or glossary updates
- **Any P0–P3 work that names 要求/要件/設計 terms** — run **`terminology-research`** first (Cursor: WebSearch + browser)

## Mandatory web research（P0–P3）

Before `design-record` or new `docs/requirements/` content:

1. Skill **`terminology-research`**（PM executes WebSearch + browser MCP）
2. Attach **Terminology alignment** block to deliberation or record draft
3. User confirms definitions when terms are disputed

Policy: `docs/TERMINOLOGY_RESEARCH_POLICY.md`

## Skills

| Purpose | Use |
|---------|-----|
| **Terminology** | **`terminology-research`**（Cursor 側・必須 P0–P3） |
| Deliberate | `design-deliberate` |
| Reference | `design-reference` |
| Record design | `design-record` |
| Record ADR/glossary | `doc-record` |
| Role | **`spec_designer`** |

## vs plan_slicer

| Phase | Role | Artifact |
|-------|------|----------|
| Deliberation & design | `spec_designer` | `docs/design/` |
| Implementation plan | `plan_slicer` | `.agents/plans/` |

Do not store deliberation in `.agents/plans/`.
